  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_NEAR" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for Neighbourhood and Enlargement Negotiations</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU support to Lebanon&apos;s Green Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall the action will contribute to improving energy security and to promoting transition to energy and resource efficiency in LebanonComponent I of the action will support the uptake of renewable energy and energy efficiency equipment in public sector buildings, hence contributing to both energy transition and a more efficient provision of public services. The private sector part of the action (component II) will focus on increasing the competitiveness of Lebanese industry by:&amp;nbsp;Fostering entrepreneurship, innovation and technology transfers for sustainable energy solutions; Supporting industries, in particular in the agro-food sector (making up about 25% of the industrial sector) to be more resource-efficient and adopt circular economy approaches in their value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
